vdr-plugin-ohpvstatus (0.4.0-1fnu0~trixie) trixie; urgency=medium

  * new upstream release 0.4.0, reviewed and reworked by Claude Opus:
    items fetched in a background thread (OSD no longer blocks), one
    HTTP connection, units W/kW/MW and %, locale independent numbers,
    missing items shown as n/a, new option --token, setup via blue key
    saves to setup.conf, German translation with umlauts as po/de_DE.po
  * added README, HISTORY and COPYING, README installed, HISTORY as
    upstream changelog
  * debian/copyright: credits Claude (Anthropic) as co-author
  * upstream is now https://github.com/unf/vdr-plugin-ohpvstatus, Homepage
    and watch point there

